WEBVTT

00:20:59.812 --> 00:21:02.982
dat zonder uitzondering ieder leven

00:21:02.982 --> 00:21:04.722
in gelijke mate

00:21:04.722 --> 00:21:06.574
oneindig waardevol is.

00:21:06.574 --> 00:21:08.095
Hartelijk bedankt.

00:21:08.095 --> 00:21:10.905
(Applaus)

00:21:10.905 --> 00:21:13.973
Bedankt. Bedankt.

00:21:13.973 --> 00:21:17.029
(Applaus)

00:21:17.029 --> 00:21:18.271
Bedankt.

00:21:18.271 --> 00:21:21.335
(Applaus)